          <p>
            Isolates and certified plant blends cost more per 25 g, but the premium buys something specific: less lactose, fewer calories, or a dairy-free base with sport certification. Pay it if you need that specific thing. If you do not, a concentrate blend like Gold Standard gives you the same chocolate shake for less.
