          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most people the best chocolate protein powder is a whey: Gold Standard Double Rich Chocolate for value, ISO100 Gourmet Chocolate if you need an isolate, PEScience Select if you want it thick, and Ghost if you want dessert. If you need dairy-free, Garden of Life Sport's chocolate pairs 30 g of protein with NSF Certified for Sport.
